OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 12, who died in crash was
OL,4,A'talented young footballer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 12-year-old boy who died when a train
OL,7,Fhit a car near Ballyhaunis in County
OL,8,FMayo has been named locally as Eoin
OL,9,FDoyle.
OL,11,FThe incident happened at about 20:45
OL,12,Flocal time on Friday, when the boy and
OL,13,Fhis father were travelling in the car
OL,14,Fat a user-operated level crossing at
OL,15,FKiltybo.
OL,17,FEoin was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
