OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 12, who died in crash was
OL,4,A'talented young footballer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis father was taken to hospital by
OL,7,Fambulance. Gardai (Irish police) have
OL,8,Fsaid that his injuries are not life
OL,9,Fthreatening. All passengers on the
OL,10,Ftrain safely disembarked.
